 <section class="help-section"><h3>Jackpot coins</h3><p>A jackpot coin contributes its named jackpot value when collected. The amounts shown above the reels already include your current bet.</p><div class="jackpot-help">${[["mini","MINI",25],["minor","MINOR",50],["major","MAJOR",150],["grand","GRAND",1e3]].map(([l,i,s])=>`<article><img src="assets/symbols/jackpot-${l}.webp?v=6" alt="${i} jackpot coin"><h4>${i}</h4><strong>${ve(t.bet*s)}</strong><span>${s}\xD7 total bet</span></article>`).join("")}</div></section>
